; Cesia_v1, the interface of native packages: a plugin that the binary loads, its code open to the engines, before the first
; engine. An engine is compiled against cesia_v1.cmi alone, whose fingerprint never changes once released: so no alias module
; (wrapped false), whose fingerprint would follow every module added, and -opaque, so that an engine records none of the code
; behind it.

(library
 (name cesia_native)
 (wrapped false)
 (flags
  (:standard -opaque))
 (libraries cesia))
